ush-up","t":10,"sets":2},{"rest":20},{"ex":"squat","t":12,"sets":2},{"rest":20},{"ex":"plank","t":35,"sets":2},{"rest":20},{"ex":"glute-bridge","t":12,"sets":2}]},{"id":"functional","name":"Functional Foundations","disc":"FUNCTIONAL","tiers":["learning","building","strong"],"blurb":"Movements that pay off outside the mat — chairs, stairs, shopping.","steps":[{"ex":"sit-to-stand","t":10},{"rest":20},{"ex":"glute-bridge","t":12},{"rest":20},{"ex":"bird-dog","t":25},{"rest":20},{"ex":"wall-sit","t":30}]},{"id":"mobility","name":"Morning Mobility","disc":"MOBILITY","tiers":["learning","building","strong"],"blurb":"Slow, breath-led. The best two minutes you can give a stiff back.","steps":[{"ex":"cat-cow","t":45},{"rest":10},{"ex":"downward-dog","t":30},{"rest":10},{"ex":"cobra","t":25},{"rest":10},{"ex":"cat-cow","t":30}]}],"dialogue":{"base":{"go":["Go.","Whenever you're ready."],"rest":["Rest. {t} seconds."],"getset":["{x} coming up."],"half":["Halfway."],"twomore":["Two more."],"tenleft":["Ten seconds."],"done":["Done."],"vis":["I can't see you — step back so I can see all of you, side-on."],"inhale":["Inhale."],"exhale":["And exhale."],"breathe":["Keep breathing."],"getin":["Get into position — I'll start the clock when you're set."],"seeBack":["Step back a little — I can't see all of you."],"seeUp":["I'm cut off at your feet — shift up, or move the phone down a touch."],"seeDown":["I can't see your head — shift down, or tilt the phone up a touch."],"seeLeft":["Slide to your left — you're out of frame on one side."],"seeRight":["Slide to your right — you're out of frame on one side."],"tooFar":["You've got room to come closer — you'll get sharper coaching."],"slower":["Slower — control it, and I'll count it."],"calib.held":["You held {t} seconds."],"turnside":["Turn side-on to the camera, so I can read your form."],"turnfront":["Turn to face the camera for this one."],"rotatetip":["Tip — floor exercises work best with the phone sideways."],"nextset":["Set {c} of {o}."],"teach.push-up":["Push-ups — {t}. Chest to the floor, body in one line."],"teach.knee-push-up":["Knee push-ups — {t}."],"teach.wall-push-up":["Wall push-ups — {t}."],"switchsides":["Other side."],"fixed":["That's it."],"goodhold":["Good."],"goodrep":["Good."],"degrade":["Form's fading — let's stop there."],"regress":["Let's try the easier version."],"encourage":["Keep going."],"pr":["Personal best. {v}."],"sag":["Hips up."],"pike":["Hips level."],"sagside":["Hips up."],"neck":["Neck neutral."],"neckpull":["Don't pull on your neck."],"backarch":["Press your back flat."],"knees":["Straighter legs."],"elbows":["Elbows under your shoulders."],"chestup":["Chest up."],"bridgehigh":["Higher — squeeze at the top."],"reachback":["Reach the leg back."],"deeper":["Go a bit deeper — all the way down."],"standtall":["All the way up — stand tall at the top."],"curlhigher":["A little higher — peel the shoulder blades up."],"liftlegs":["Higher — lift them a bit further."],"extendlong":["Reach it further — long and straight."],"chestlower":["Lower — bring your chest closer."],"kneesin":["Knees back in toward your chest."],"liftchest":["Lift the chest a little higher."],"cobraeasy":["Ease off a touch — no need to crank it."],"straighten":["Straight line — head to heels, no bend at the hips."],"backwall":["Press your back flat against the wall."],"reachforward":["Reach the arm forward."],"sitlower":["Lower."],"hipshigh":["Hips up and back."],"longspine":["Long spine."],"shouldersdown":["Shoulders down."],"hollowlift":["Lift."],"hollowlow":["Legs lower."],"frameTop":["Part of your body is outside the top of the picture. Adjust the camera so the movement fits."],"frameBottom":["Part of your body is outside the bottom of the picture. Adjust the camera so the movement fits."],"trackingLost":["I can't track the movement clearly. Check the camera picture; counting is paused."],"repPosition":["Counting is paused. Return to the starting position, then begin a new rep."],"setupShape":["The starting shape is not ready yet. Check the demonstration, or try the easier option if offered."]},"tiers":{"learning":{"start":["Hi{n}. We'll take this at your pace. Turn sideways to the camera, and prop the phone low down, far enough back that I can see all of you."],"go":["Whenever you're ready — no rush.","Off you go."],"calibverdict":["That's a completely normal starting point — most people can't hold a clean plank at all at first. I'll teach you the movements from the ground up, one thing at a time."],"seeBack":["Take a step back so I can see all of you — head to heels needs to fit in the frame.","Shuffle back a bit — I can only see part of you, and I want to watch your whole body."],"seeUp":["Your feet are out of the picture — shift yourself up, or move the phone a little lower.","I've lost your feet — either move up, or slide the phone down so your whole body fits."],"seeDown":["I can't see your head — shift down a bit, or tilt the phone up slightly.","Your head's out of frame — move down, or angle the phone up a touch."],"seeLeft":["You've drifted out of frame — slide to your left until you're back in the middle."],"seeRight":["You've drifted out of frame — slide to your right until you're back in the middle."],"tooFar":["You're quite far away — come in closer and I'll be able to see your form much better.","Shuffle in a bit closer — the nearer you are, the more clearly I can coach you."],"slower":["That one was too quick for me to count — slow it right down, especially on the way back. Control is the whole point.","Slow it down — take a couple of seconds each way. Rushing it means your muscles aren't really doing the work."],"getin":["Take your time getting into position. I won't start the clock until you're set.","No rush — get yourself set, and I'll start counting when you're in the shape."],"turnside":["Turn so I see you from the side — side-on is where I can really help you."],"turnfront":["Turn and face the camera for this one — that's the angle I read best."],"rotatetip":["Quick tip — for floor exercises, turning your phone sideways gives me a much better view of you."],"rest":["Rest. Take {t} seconds — proper rest is part of the work."],"done":["Good. Rest.","That's the set. Well done."],"teach.plank":["Plank. Forearms down, elbows under your shoulders, body in one straight line from your ears to your heels. It's completely normal to shake — that's the muscle working. {t} seconds."],"teach.knee-plank":["Knee plank. Same shape, knees down. Straight line from your ears to your knees. {t} seconds."],"teach.side-plank-knee":["Side plank on your knee. Elbow under your shoulder, lift your hips so you're straight from head to knees. {t} seconds."],"teach.dead-bug":["Dead bug. On your back, arms up, knees up. Lower one arm and the opposite leg slowly, keeping your lower back pressed flat into the floor. That flat back is the whole point. {t} reps."],"teach.bird-dog":["Bird dog. On all fours. Reach one arm forward and the opposite leg back, until both are in line with your back. Imagine balancing a glass of water on your lower back."],"teach.glute-bridge":["Glute bridge. On your back, knees bent, feet flat. Push through your heels and lift your hips into a straight ramp. Squeeze at the top. {t} reps."],"teach.sit-to-stand":["Sit to stand. From a chair, no hands. Lean your chest forward, drive through your feet, stand all the way up. Sit back down slowly — that's the hard bit. {t} reps."],"teach.wall-sit":["Wall sit. Back flat against a wall, slide down until your knees are bent at about a right angle. Then just hold. {t} seconds."],"teach.hollow-tuck":["Tucked hollow hold. On your back, knees pulled in, shoulders just off the floor. One job: press your lower back into the floor. {t} seconds."],"teach.crunch":["Crunch. On your back, knees bent. Peel your shoulder blades off the floor with your tummy — hands beside your head, never pulling on your neck. {t} reps."],"teach.leg-raise-bent":["Bent-knee leg raise. On your back, knees bent, lift them towards your chest and lower slowly. If your lower back lifts off the floor, you've gone too far. {t} reps."],"teach.cat-cow":["Cat cow. On all fours. Round your back to the ceiling as you breathe out, then let it dip as you breathe in. Slow — this is a stretch, not an exercise. I'll breathe with you."],"teach.downward-dog":["Downward dog. Hands and feet down, hips pushed up and back into an upside-down V. A long spine matters more than straight legs — bend your knees as much as you need."],"teach.cobra":["Cobra. On your front, hands under your shoulders, gently lift your chest. Keep your shoulders down, away from your ears. This should feel good, never sharp."],"teach.knee-push-up":["Knee push-up. Hands under your shoulders, knees on the floor, body straight from your head to your knees. Bend your elbows to lower your chest, then push the floor away. {t} reps."],"teach.wall-push-up":["Wall push-up. Stand an arm's length from a wall, hands flat on it at shoulder height. Bend your elbows to bring your chest to the wall, then push back. This is the right place to start — every push-up begins here. {t} reps."],"nextset":["Set {c} of {o}. Same as before — quality first, and rest whenever you need."],"sag":["Your hips are dipping towards the floor. Squeeze your bum and lift them, so your body's one straight line.","Hips are sinking. Squeeze your backside and lift them back into line.","Your middle's sagging. Tighten your tummy and your bum, and lift."],"pike":["Your hips are up too high. Bring them down a little — flat from your shoulders to your heels."],"sagside":["Let your bottom hip lift towards the ceiling — don't let it sink."],"neck":["Let your head hang naturally. Look at the floor just in front of your hands."],"neckpull":["Don't pull on your neck — chin soft, lift with your tummy."],"backarch":["Your lower back is arching off the floor. Press it flat and make the movement smaller."],"knees":["Try to keep your legs a bit straighter — a 